Package: fastASSETcli
Type: Package
Title: Reference-Aligned FastASSET Command-Line Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jibin", "John", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "69025183+JIBINJOHNV@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Runs a reference-aligned fastASSET workflow for large collections
    of quantitative traits. The package loads a separately saved GenomicSEM
    LDSC object, restores and audits trait labels, reorders the intercept
    covariance matrix, normalizes it to a trait correlation matrix, performs
    directional fastASSET subset testing, writes the ASSET fixed-effect Meta
    component, and records severity-ranked quality control.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ASSET,
    data.table,
    parallel,
    stats,
    tools,
    utils
URL: https://github.com/JIBINJOHNV/fastASSETcli,
    https://github.com/gqi/fastASSET
BugReports: https://github.com/JIBINJOHNV/fastASSETcli/issues
SystemRequirements: gzip; fork-based parallelism requires Linux or macOS
